OL,3,GNEWSAMan aged in his 40s dies in County
OL,4,ADonegal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man aged in his 40s has been knocked
OL,7,Fdown and killed in County Donegal.
OL,9,FHe was hit by a car on the R238 at
OL,10,FDrumskellan near the border village of
OL,11,FMuff at about 20:30 local time on
OL,12,FSunday.
OL,14,FThe man was pronounced dead at the
OL,15,Fscene and his body has been taken to
OL,16,FLetterkenny University Hospital for a
OL,17,Fpost-mortem examination.
OL,19,FThe road remains closed for technical
OL,20,Fexamination by Garda forensic collision
OL,21,Finvestigators and local diversions are
OL,22,Fin place.
OL,23,APub: 23-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
